{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "66d4599f85613bf7ccbbd118af0e46f25ff9f14c7339c84d16857dfad9e55937", "ja": "人生の大先輩", "zh": "人生的资深前辈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cf49f6a085b873f5d5a5eb5a382674d7f3f3399adaecfe0a0a1fd1a7e4a41ee2", "ja": "「自分が楽しいと思うこと」を教え合うこと\nにした美也とエレナ。まずは美也の紹介で、\n囲碁将棋センターに向かう。そこで将棋や\nおじいちゃん達との会話を楽しんだエレナは\n美也の今まで知らなかった一面を知る。", "zh": "美也和艾琳娜决定告诉彼此\n「觉得好玩的事情」。在美也的介绍下，\n她们来到了围棋将棋中心。艾琳娜在那边\n体验到下棋与陪老爷爷们聊天的乐趣，\n得知了美也至今没有表露出来的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "72f80b28adceb0375b0abdbe167cd0461315cae7bbe29a9cdd1ec3555e6f978c", "ja": "休日の朝……", "zh": "假日早上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2d73c83281eaf87afd66a0daa9c57bd5c2876818123ad42f7b506ae6c640ae0", "ja": "おはよー、ミヤ！\nねえ、今日はどこに行くノ？", "zh": "早啊──美也！\n欸，我们今天要去哪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "bb066b55f713cc9423a43ff36bd16157f17140133392bcf79b53cddfba6802e5", "ja": "はい～。今日は私が、\nいつも行っているところに、ご案内しようかと～。", "zh": "早～今天，\n我想带你去我平常去的地方～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0250a24eb64d9007c1607f766bf2c60cae29650c54c324e82fe009a6ea2e506", "ja": "ハーイ♪\n美也の楽しいコト、教えてもらうヨー。", "zh": "好──♪\n美也觉得有趣的事，通通跟我说吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "9a9dcaf5c031776d7335c839feabb46704670fd19d7db765e02104b9c3e1a81c", "ja": "それでは、参りましょう～。\nレッツ、ゴー♪", "zh": "那我们出发～\nLet's go♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "0b62c76b32f36081e85257ed72ec5da27022697b615088cdaa0f326265226ae9", "ja": "イェーイ♪", "zh": "耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "193982d55b8ae838e5ceed32234d622823eb01a71e4e385dad948022e1ad329a", "ja": "わ、おじいちゃんがいっぱい！？　ここって、\n何かのお店……？　ねぇミヤ、みんな何やってるノ？", "zh": "哇，好多老爷爷喔！？\n这里是商家吗……？欸，美也，他们在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "2cb3af12b9f1f5a14080aa7b5a6ef40843e37bda33c22fba02179c212989e309", "ja": "ここは、囲碁と将棋ができるお店なんですよ～。\nどちらでも、好きな方で対戦できます～。", "zh": "这里是可以下围棋跟将棋的店喔～\n不论哪种，都可以自由挑选对手～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "71540f22da7f8dc770785c34443bbead12cfb862b1ea272a2bd8f05e82bdfce2", "ja": "ヘーッ！\n囲碁と将棋ができるお店なんてあるんだネ。", "zh": "哦──！\n居然有可以下围棋跟将棋的店呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "57832e7a184a19ecc6f4b49cbb2b10e6b004934cdfb8a7688956e739c922ef4e", "ja": "それに、劇場の近くにこんなお店があったなんて、\n全然知らなかったヨ。ミヤは、いつも来てるの？", "zh": "而且，我完全不晓得剧场附近\n就有这么一家店呢。美也很常来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "9d5411207f1d7d77bee7969f51f9ad8ebbb9c6b33c9b29e1023ec21befc214a6", "ja": "はい、レッスンがお休みの時に～。将棋を指したり、\nおじいちゃん達とおしゃべりをしたりしてますよ～。", "zh": "嗯，不用练习的时候～我常来这里下将棋，\n或是跟老爷爷们聊天喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1011_tenshu", "source_sha256": "cdfb6321ca1e352f32b144596e119d15a882726f9c1263fa1546946bd689dcba", "ja": "美也ちゃん、いらっしゃい。\n……おや、今日はお友達と一緒かい？", "zh": "美也，欢迎光临。\n……哎呀，今天跟朋友一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "b6c98c354cda1c88bb8a10acc9f43ae4986f2b9243ff5bb66285726121e0f84b", "ja": "はい～。今日はアイドルのお友達と一緒なんですよ～。\n島原エレナさんです～。", "zh": "是的～我今天跟一起当偶像的朋友来～\n她叫做岛原艾琳娜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd1043118d081ed82e08f9744ec4b27cf3d2eaa126be5e0dece93f22e315f97b", "ja": "エレナさん、紹介しますね～。\nこちらは、このお店の店主さんです～。", "zh": "艾琳娜，跟你介绍一下～\n这位是这间店的老板～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc308db6bc27c584ab4951eec6c198431dd42159cca90e620249d303aa4610c1", "ja": "初めまして、エレナだヨ♪\nワタシとも仲良くしてネ、おじいちゃん！", "zh": "你好，我是艾琳娜♪\n也请你多多关照啰，老爷爷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1015_tenshu", "source_sha256": "add51534854b7442ecf7747febefefef10ebc3346b0f433937556334a900b1d0", "ja": "よろしく、エレナちゃん。", "zh": "欢迎你，艾琳娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1016_rojin", "source_sha256": "118d8c4e63d6748e6bbd2ad07bb77f48c309e27b62ff81750031f28e0a2f7ad0", "ja": "おお、こりゃ美人さんだのう！\nさすが美也ちゃんのお友達じゃなあ。", "zh": "喔喔，好一个美女啊！\n真不愧是美也的朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "a01cad968899561c3832d3991df80bcfa345c8e2f0e411705c59df5a9e6347b3", "ja": "エヘヘ。美人だなんて、照れちゃうヨ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，说人家美女，人家会害羞啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "c796cdbdc497b271fc36c44c25a9e3dff86f9073518db5642a1818162d04c901", "ja": "今日はここで、一緒に将棋をやりましょう～。\nエレナさん、将棋をやったことはありますか～？", "zh": "我们今天就在这一起下将棋吧～\n艾琳娜，你有下过将棋吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "263b885ae3a8e39dc62eda3958cf288f0d0eae839fcef936eff36a36f5ab7147", "ja": "ううん。知ってるけど、ルールは全然知らないノ……。\nでもパチパチ打つの、楽しそうだしカッコイイよネ！", "zh": "没有。我虽然知道这个东西，但完全不晓得规则……\n不过，这样叩叩叩地把棋子打出去，感觉好玩又帅气呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "c22afecdb739b2f969507a232bbd5879aaf2c972426c332ee5c7d1306b2dff45", "ja": "はい、とっても楽しいですよ～。\nちなみに将棋は、打つではなく指すといいます～。", "zh": "嗯，非常有意思喔～\n顺带一提，将棋的动词是用下，不是打喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "bf220a056203f854fbed2d83ed01f2044df931729f8821a71320eae78ed617f0", "ja": "ではまずは、簡単なルールを説明しますね～。\nその後、実際に対戦してみましょう～。", "zh": "那我先来简单说明一下规则～\n等等就实际对弈看看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "0c42e6da5687018947b4432454ad6ed56e66037cf7aef9b998e15568cc4f90fa", "ja": "うん、わかったヨ！\nエヘヘ、ミヤセンセー、よろしくネ！", "zh": "嗯，我懂了！\n嘿嘿，美也老师，请指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "62f64d270cac00bca4a0d4d39659a19c22b34aef4a6e4c51166a7d97b5c015e6", "ja": "おー。今のは、なかなかいい手ですよ～。\nこれは私も、本気を出さないといけませんな～。", "zh": "喔～刚刚那棋走得很不错呢～\n这样我也得拿出实力了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "8226cf06671e56fa8baa8584c837062179106e33d66113076b9284a3a1a7f9a2", "ja": "……えーっと。\nミヤの、と金が来てるから……ここかナ？", "zh": "……我想想。\n美也的成金攻过来了……我应该下这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1025_tenshu", "source_sha256": "792f55b23e52b729de054e8b195ce36cb9244cee3a224a689f773f6802f4a887", "ja": "ふーむ……そこは攻めるより、\n守ったほうがいいかもしれんのう。", "zh": "嗯……这种时候与其进攻，\n采取防守可能会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "5742e0ca30c67272f9157f4d2316cb2e8c939f8652fda060d2333057c47cabcf", "ja": "えっ、どうして？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1027_rojin", "source_sha256": "7f467d861cf86f7e449ea09e2e9cccc24fbed6593090345089282f836824cd90", "ja": "いやいや、エレナちゃんがそこを攻めると、\nこっちがこう来てだね……ほら。", "zh": "哎呀呀，艾琳娜进攻那里的话，\n这边只要走这步……你瞧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a306a032bbf9bb683ecd9347e3b316ac320c0d8fc0e31fbc6a33f50bb6424cb", "ja": "ワオ、ホントだ！　ここで攻めると、\nこっち側がピンチになっちゃうんだネ。", "zh": "哇，真的耶！这时候进攻，\n就会让这一侧变得毫无防备呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "9853728648cfe64f75d6295d89edafd46a0af202b5761bdbf69638c55fb8f3e2", "ja": "ワタシ、全然気づかなかったヨー。\n教えてくれてありがと、おじいちゃん♪", "zh": "我一点都没发现耶～\n谢谢你跟我说，老爷爷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1030_rojin", "source_sha256": "3c2922669311427a422e64de7215219a835c3062efbbbc5ae8276fc0bbeeee60", "ja": "いやいや、なんのなんの。", "zh": "哎呀呀，不用谢不用谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1031_tenshu", "source_sha256": "ce15b68da841f25a053dbab9df1446401411ab07a40b8709d8bcef14a35911d9", "ja": "ほっほっほ。\nさあ美也ちゃん、どう返すかね？", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n好了，美也，你要怎么反击？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "785abcecec671dfdde06a619a9734b3894846b55d904cdbc765f3b0294c62bcb", "ja": "むふふ。エレナさん、楽しんでますな～。\nでは、次は私の番ですよ～。", "zh": "呵呵呵。艾琳娜，你玩得很开心嘛～\n接下来换我啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "b0f77a85270f2c37cd505dc4e003e376ea40b302f6a4411a11961005b915cbb6", "ja": "う～……もう、どこにも逃げられないノ……。\nダメ、降参だヨ～！", "zh": "呜……已经无处可逃了……\n不行，我投降～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "c85ead546c15ed419054b6b8afff527ad24142ec0482bff04615b962ab274b43", "ja": "なかなか、良い勝負ができましたね～。\nエレナさん、ありがとうございました～。", "zh": "这一盘棋下得真是精采～\n艾琳娜，谢谢指教～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ffe8ed72533e9d14e1d455ca777950b4ee955e788cf00e7613672e0f2d557bb", "ja": "うう……負けちゃって悔しいヨ……。\nミヤ、将棋強いんだネ！", "zh": "呜呜……输了真不甘心……\n美也很会下将棋呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1036_tenshu", "source_sha256": "4f9b6576c7a8e512ad2e442e5c08447e273c243a87ea76f56dcea40ee27d94b5", "ja": "そうじゃなあ。\n美也ちゃんはこの店の中で、一番強いかもしれん。", "zh": "对呀。\n美也应该是店里棋艺最强的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "106dfac81c9589d19278b90bc58cebd4445c9e29cff44209d52fc30b46125a98", "ja": "えーっ！　そうなノ！？", "zh": "咦──！是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1038_tenshu", "source_sha256": "195242177c6974ea002519772237d99ba0aaa55df90d0986a9ce34528e5c138e", "ja": "うむ。若い女の子がひとりでふらっと入ってきて、\n最初は物珍しさからみんな話しかけてたんじゃがのう。", "zh": "嗯。看到年轻姑娘自己一个人跑到这里来，\n大家起初都是出于好奇去找她搭话的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1039_tenshu", "source_sha256": "65fa4c6ca4afbfc38916ae7e9bb89de11b0fa744a718959b2916bc8f5d5ab96e", "ja": "今ではみんな、美也ちゃんと対戦したり、\n棋譜の話をするのが楽しくて仕方がないんじゃよ。", "zh": "到现在啊，\n每个人都很享受跟美也对弈、聊棋谱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "2fd71c560d7a9e0d4f5d6185d29de2319947ddb51ad5314947c9df8bbd08f989", "ja": "棋譜？　……って、何？", "zh": "棋谱？那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "113880003f9994d7097d270fdf6d40e3b5dbb81664fc3a42d930677f7074a61d", "ja": "将棋の、対局の記録です～。どの駒がどこに移動したか\n書いてあって、研究に使ったりするんですよ～。", "zh": "就是将棋对弈的纪录～写着哪一子移动到哪一格，\n常用来研究棋手的棋路～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "1ec9c3b032f78acfd79a89d5f4b5cf5da0d07d0c57fc2b40c49249fd5b2e6ea2", "ja": "へ～……。", "zh": "哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1043_tenshu", "source_sha256": "276d8fedf68a0d7d6dd40952da88eb0bbd09e7a750f8e37ebc3fcd40fa552120", "ja": "そんな美也ちゃんと、ハンデ戦とはいえ\n互角にやりあったからのう。", "zh": "虽说有放水，但你也跟\n这么厉害的美也下得平分秋色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1044_tenshu", "source_sha256": "d0fa845518b124552b304a952055e5de8ecaf6fe3d919c4dd0137502f2d57f53", "ja": "エレナちゃんにも、将棋の才能があるんじゃないかの？\nほっほっほ。", "zh": "说不定艾琳娜也有下将棋的天赋呢！\n呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "c0ab4e2dc3d0ccd5dbd4722ec1589b179f09c608185dace2c2b906948cd1f7ff", "ja": "はい～。エレナさんも、\nきっと立派な、将棋アイドルになれますよ～。", "zh": "对啊～艾琳娜一定也可以\n成为厉害的将棋偶像的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "0ace3fdfdb4a7ade752933dd5aebb277ddc2e7d997899edb8c9cde3fb1764c7a", "ja": "エヘヘ、そうかナ……♪　照れちゃうネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吗……♪真叫人害羞♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1047_tenshu", "source_sha256": "b44a160318975627dda36467aca83edcdf9429250d2366ebe2d528212ee6a728", "ja": "どれ、ワシは茶菓子でも持ってこようかの。\nふたりとも、ゆっくりしておいで。", "zh": "我去拿些配茶的点心过来。\n你们俩慢慢玩呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "79f61e5e95254914bab415fc34ca6ab6116826312c11fdc0609c83a3c67b3dab", "ja": "はい～、ありがとうございます～。", "zh": "好的～谢谢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "dd74275be803664ba7fd63f47bef43a9c0a9aea34bc76da4579275b6644aeaa2", "ja": "ねーねー、ミヤ。\nミヤは、おじいちゃんと仲良しなんだね？", "zh": "欸欸，美也。\n美也跟老爷爷很熟对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "f4c92a2fc0007175737703d31ee8ba36349f98441088a038b04a23b4cbf4f85a", "ja": "ふふふ、そうですね～。\nみんなと、仲良くしていますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，对呀～\n我跟这里的大家感情都不错～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "01aeab0f57c33e0c997d525bd3de17a12bf725d9009f02808f7b3bca0ef7c794", "ja": "おじいちゃんだらけで、最初はちょっと\nビックリしたけど……なんだか、面白い場所ダネ。", "zh": "看到这里都是老爷爷，我一开始有点吓到……\n不过，这里感觉很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1052_018ele", "source_sha256": "ff859f11196df433dd9d8319eb74f20e954ec5bfce9b7f3700ccfc4b3f050080", "ja": "それに、おじいちゃん達、みーんな物知りだし。\n話してると、すっごく楽しいヨー！", "zh": "而且老爷爷们都懂好多事情。\n跟他们聊天真的好有意思喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1053_042miy", "source_sha256": "fc2d2e9a914c02408d2e507ad5692bb68c0ce3f8c150cbd7b4acfe4ce7d81133", "ja": "ふっふっふ。\nみなさん、人生の大先輩ですからな～。", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n因为大家都是人生这条路上的资深前辈呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "e25df5320adc5c45a4329487e5f457cf7b3c3c285219227a357f8be9ec417b10", "ja": "それに、アイドルのことにも、\nとっても詳しかったりするんですよ～。", "zh": "而且，有些人对偶像的事情\n也了若指掌喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1055_018ele", "source_sha256": "9798ef8575e66449fda51ef68ad88047239ac02dcc0b108c38ba7e94083a311a", "ja": "へーっ、そうなんだ！？　……あっ、おじいちゃん！\nねえねえ、アイドルに詳しいノ！？", "zh": "哦～真的啊！？啊，老爷爷！\n欸欸，你对偶像很熟悉吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1056_018ele", "source_sha256": "9275b82fc6457bd438354caa1cd33d57bf7941fb2099ec5a1c560ee9a5922c50", "ja": "楽しかったー！\n将棋も、思ったよりずーっと面白かったし……。", "zh": "真好玩──！\n将棋也比我想的还有意思多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1057_018ele", "source_sha256": "50d69b50cb1c03740302ea62033bf6fea15c80c3e619be51742d1bb70cf8f843", "ja": "ミヤにルールを教えてもらうまで、ワタシ、\n将棋ってもっと難しいゲームだと思ってたヨー。", "zh": "在美也教我规则以前，\n我一直觉得将棋是非常难的游戏呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1058_042miy", "source_sha256": "e4bdb25e283b4da874e4f5b05aba74a69df311a33b81a8dddbf298a793baf26f", "ja": "駒の動きを覚えるまでは、ちょっと大変ですけど～。\n慣れてしまえば、簡単なんですよ～。", "zh": "在记住棋子的走法以前，玩起来是有点辛苦没错～\n但习惯以后就很简单啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1059_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b5862a6395f8fd679124f06444ec49f00af1f18a6ca0542962d40f23eb94985", "ja": "今日一日でワタシ、ミヤのコト\nい～っぱい知った気がする！", "zh": "今天一整天，我觉得自己\n更更更～理解美也了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1060_042miy", "source_sha256": "e4c014cad660f9662faafe9f6eec9a749da805f3f35e84b472846669073058e1", "ja": "そうですか～。\nそれは、なんだか嬉しいですね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "这样啊～\n那还真让人开心～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1061_018ele", "source_sha256": "caf0da230a42dbb14fcf1c3f21cfe5a7f778494f5456e00929019647d7904a6a", "ja": "でもネ、不思議なんだヨ。いつものミヤなのに、\n今日は少し違うヒトに見えたノ……どうしてかナ？", "zh": "不过，好神奇喔。美也明明跟平时一样，\n但今天却感觉有点像不同的人……这是为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1062_042miy", "source_sha256": "3fa281cc1afe632081c836ec2d35b80b336afa58bee6c51528db46d066dfd00e", "ja": "そうなんですか～？　それは不思議ですね～。\n私はいつでも、私なのですが～。", "zh": "是吗～？那真的很神奇呢～\n我无论何时都不会变才对～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1063_042miy", "source_sha256": "288345ae17892eb0f506efa767798ae02abb14ad61624099e6f820fc427329e4", "ja": "でも……私もお友達と一緒は初めてなので、\nちょっぴりドキドキしました～。", "zh": "不过……我也是第一次跟朋友一起来，\n心里有那么点紧张呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1064_042miy", "source_sha256": "4ead6d54c1f52cda062d40895cb32ef43603488d8df63645ee9d73d28c3815d7", "ja": "だからエレナさんに「楽しかった」って\n言ってもらえて、とっても嬉しかったですよ～。", "zh": "听到艾琳娜说「好玩」的时候，\n我真的非常开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1065_018ele", "source_sha256": "5ddeb11205354889ee6abfe16b0063077ed3dab271fd2d9f82025ca2b9ab47e0", "ja": "ミヤ……。", "zh": "美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1066_042miy", "source_sha256": "f8ceddcaf46a2874438ab1831e68e496ca35bb500a67918811f6a3cc245b9bd9", "ja": "エレナさん。\nまた一緒に、対局しましょうね～。", "zh": "艾琳娜，\n下次再一起对弈吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1067_018ele", "source_sha256": "dbe03c079927c825e20857fb22a5ba2264fbc24e63337f0cafcaf6d835fbcb8f", "ja": "……うん！\n次は絶対、ミヤに勝ってみせるヨ～！", "zh": "……嗯！\n我下次一定要赢过美也～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_03_1068_042miy", "source_sha256": "0764bacc0d9d0a4ae32bd19cf2dfbf1c7dacbcef8371685ab268b7c4ead58df7", "ja": "はい～。私も、負けませんよ～。ふふふ♪", "zh": "好～我也不会输的～呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
